== \AdLint 3.4.0 - Advanced Lint - Innoventix fork

\AdLint is a source code static analyzer.

It can point out unreliable or nonportable code fragments, and can measure
various quality metrics of the source code.

It (currently) can analyze source code compliant with ANSI C89 / ISO C90 and
partly ISO C99.

This is the Innoventix maintained fork, based on \AdLint 3.2.14, originally
written by Yutaka Yanoh and OGIS-RI Co.,Ltd. The version date is 2026-11-19.
The maintainer contact is Pieter Marx <pietermarx@innoventix.co.za>.

For more details, visit
<{https\://github.com/Pieter-Marx-Innoventix/adlint}[https://github.com/Pieter-Marx-Innoventix/adlint]>.

